/td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1244\">std::<span class=\"me2\">u32string</span></span></a> generic_u32string<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the internal pathname in generic pathname format, converted to specific string type. Conversion, if any, is specified in todo. The <code>/</code> character is used as the directory separator. \n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> All memory allocations are performed by <code>a</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The encoding in the case of <code>u8string()</code> is always UTF-8.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  a\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  allocator to construct the string with\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>CharT</code> must be one of the encoded character types (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char16_t</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char32_t</span></span></code>)\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The internal pathname in generic pathname format, converted to specified string type.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/string\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>string</span><span>wstring</span><span>u8string</span><span>u16string</span><span>u32string</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the path in native pathname format converted to a string <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::generic_string,generic_wstring,generic_u8string,...","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"6 declarations. Returns the internal pathname in generic pathname format, converted to specific string type."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"a"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The internal pathname in generic pathname format, converted to specified string type."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"string, wstring, u8string, …","note":"returns the path in native pathname format converted to a string"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":148,"codeBlockCount":0}
